      "x_offset": 0,
      "y_offset": 0,
      "note": "动画资源ID范围: 300-414，共115帧。文件编号计算：file_index = resource_id + id_to_file_offset (即 resource_id - 300)。资源ID 300→M_00000, 301→M_00001...414→M_00114"
